<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JCI finalising coal deal, advises caution.</title>
<headline>JCI finalising coal deal, advises caution.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>JCI Ltd announced on Monday that, further to a cautionary announcement on February 14, the proposed purchase of Shell South Africa's coal business was still being finalised.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to continue exercising caution in their sharedealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
